&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary People&lt;/strong&gt; – we’re not kidding!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meaningful Mission&lt;/strong&gt;– Helping revolutionize an industry and deliver better experiences for fans and clients around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
