&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with low-code development platforms, especially Mendix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in modern web frameworks such as ReactJS, AngularJS, VueJS, Typescript, ES6, jQuery, Bootstrap, HTML5, and/or CSS3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in development for mobile platforms, including mobile-first web page design as well as native app development using Swift, Kotlin, Java, or React Native&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience building mobile applications, single page web applications, and responsive websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining, developing and maintaining REST-based interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
