&lt;li&gt;Experience with deployment tools and techniques such as Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, Buddy, Jenkins, and AWS services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ticketing and live events, including music festivals, conventions, and sporting events&lt;/li&gt;
