&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documenting projects so that other team members can easily understand scope, function, and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to learn new skills quickly and find the best solutions to new projects and endeavors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
