&lt;p&gt;AXS connects fans with the artists and teams they love. Each year we sell millions of tickets to thousands of incredible events – from concerts and festivals to sports and theater – at some of the most iconic venues in the world. Since our founding in 2011, we’ve consistently pushed the industry forward and improved experiences for fans, making it easier than ever to discover events, find the perfect seats, and enjoy unforgettable live entertainment, and we continue to lead the evolution of our industry today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re passionate about improving the fan experience and providing game-changing solutions for our clients, and we’re always looking for smart, motivated people to help make it happen. Bring your enthusiasm, your big ideas, and your desire to team up with some of the best and brightest in technology and entertainment. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AXS is seeking a Graphic Design Specialist to join our Carbonhouse team in Charlotte, NC. This role will support the creative department by assisting in the efficient management and execution of various design-related tasks for internal and client-based work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist creative department with assembling, uploading and organizing design assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mock up assets for digital templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design a variety of digital assets for social media and web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The design specialist will assist web designers in working with clients on their website design and may take on their own client design projects as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare print and branding colleterial, as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare Email Templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will You Bring?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AA/AS Degree (2-year) (BA/BS Degree Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years experience of graphic design, internship, freelance experience or equivalent college degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competency in Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Adobe Creative Suite: Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multi-task different projects in a fast-paced environment in an organized manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent skills in typography, branding and layout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
