&lt;li&gt;Own the rollout of weekly B2C email marketing campaigns, including newsletters, solus emails, and ad-hoc communications, using Salesforce Marketing Cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and publish engaging content across social media channels, ensuring alignment with both artist and AXS brand guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support B2B business development through marketing communications, campaign support, and sales-facing materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver brand awareness initiatives that strengthen brand presence and drive audience engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor competitor and market activity and provide regular insights and feedback to inform marketing activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, manage, and optimize paid social and Google Ads campaigns based on performance and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales teams to support commercial activity and lead generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build weekly and monthly performance reports in Looker for senior stakeholders, sharing insights and recommendations for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape B2C and B2B marketing priorities for the Japanese market, aligned with business objectives and global marketing direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set, track, and analyze key business and marketing KPIs, using data to identify issues, growth opportunities, and areas for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, execute, measure, and optimize marketing initiatives to improve customer engagement, conversion, ticket sales, and support business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
