&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with the Client Services Team to ensure processes are maintained and to continuously identify opportunities for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that AXS.com copy meets SEO requirements. Ensure that copy on each page is edited to be concise, relevant, refreshed and focused on improving search performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the venues and promoters ticketing teams to ensure that processes are maintained and reviewed regularly to improve usability. This includes occasional face to face client meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send B2B communications and product updates in collaboration with the sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update AXS Tickets B2B Solutions website and updating company LinkedIn page&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead day-to-day social media communications, with a focus on growing followers and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
