&lt;li&gt;Strong project management, prioritization, organizational, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use search, support, engagement, and adoption data to identify knowledge gaps and improve education resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and adapt to changing products, processes, and release timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Office or comparable productivity, collaboration, project management, content, analytics, and communication tools.&lt;/li&gt;
